// Dedicated tsconfig for the Next.js App Router app (Phase 6.1, issue #17),
// separate from the root tsconfig.json/tsconfig.api.json which compile/
// typecheck src/ and api/ for the bot and its Vercel job/webhook functions.
// Wired up via next.config.ts's typescript.tsconfigPath so `next build`/
// `next dev` use this one, and also run standalone via `npm run typecheck`
// (see package.json).
{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2017",
    "lib": ["dom", "dom.iterable", "esnext"],
    "allowJs": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "strict": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "module": "esnext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "jsx": "preserve",
    "incremental": true,
    "noUncheckedIndexedAccess": true,
    "plugins": [{ "name": "next" }]
  },
  "include": ["next-env.d.ts", "app/**/*.ts", "app/**/*.tsx", ".next/types/**/*.ts"],
  "exclude": ["node_modules"]
}
